#====================================================================
# E543 draft — Conan target profile can make can_run() a false positive
# on a non-target runner; preserve L1e dependency evidence and run the
# functional test through QEMU or an AArch64 target.
#====================================================================

id:                     E543
trigger_tool:           conan|test_package|qemu
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        Exec format error|Could not open '/lib/ld-musl-aarch64\.so\.1'|cannot execute binary file|test passed WITHOUT package artifacts|Skipping target execution on a non-AArch64 build machine

severity:               2
category:               conan, testing, cross-compile, ohos
match_keywords:         Conan test_package, can_run, armv8, aarch64, x86_64, QEMU_LD_PREFIX, qemu-aarch64, Exec format error, destructive negative test, package artifact
title:                  Conan test_package 不能把同 target profile 误判为本机可运行

root_cause:             Conan 的 can_run() 依据 host/build settings 判断可运行性；当 OHOS/armv8 profile 同时传给 host 和 build 时，它会返回 true，即使实际 runner 是 Linux/x86_64。test_package 随后直接运行 aarch64 musl ELF，出现 Exec format error 或缺少 /lib/ld-musl-aarch64.so.1。若简单 return 跳过测试，L1e 破坏性反向测试会误判测试不依赖被测包，或丢失真实功能执行证据。
affected_scope:         所有在 Linux/x86_64 runner 上使用同一 OHOS/armv8 Conan profile 构建，并在 test_package 中执行 aarch64 可执行文件的命令行工具和消费者测试。
verification_cmd:       QEMU_LD_PREFIX=<ohos-fakeroot> qemu-aarch64 -L "$QEMU_LD_PREFIX" <package_folder>/bin/<tool> --help; CI_PACKAGES=archives/l/lcab/1.0b12 zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           explicit-target-runner-with-artifact-assertion
rec_description:        优先在 AArch64 OHOS runner 上执行 test_package；x86 runner 则配置 qemu-aarch64 与含 lib/ld-musl-aarch64.so.1 的 QEMU_LD_PREFIX 后运行同一已安装二进制。若 CI 当前不能提供 QEMU，非目标架构分支只能在确认 self.dependencies[package].package_folder/bin/<tool> 存在后跳过执行，以保留 L1e 对安装产物的依赖证明；完整功能测试必须另用 QEMU 或 AArch64 runner 执行并如实写入测试报告。
rec_command:            QEMU_LD_PREFIX=<ohos-fakeroot> qemu-aarch64 -L "$QEMU_LD_PREFIX" <package_folder>/bin/<tool> <functional-args>
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               target-runner-or-qemu

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      artifact-assertion-plus-external-qemu-evidence
fallback_description:   没有 QEMU 的构建机中，test() 先断言被测包的 bin/<tool> 存在，再仅对非 AArch64 runner 返回；在独立 QEMU/AArch64 环境执行相同功能脚本，记录命令、场景数和断言数。此回退不是功能测试通过的替代品。
fallback_command:       test -f "<package_folder>/bin/<tool>" && qemu-aarch64 <static-or-sysroot-configured-tool> <functional-args>
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          external-functional-evidence

forbid_1_pattern:       can_run\(self\).*return|test\(self\).*return.*can_run|skip.*without.*package.*artifact
forbid_1_reason:        仅依赖 can_run() 或直接 return 会把 profile 相同误当作 CPU/ABI 相同，且可能让 L1e 的破坏性反向测试把空测试判为通过。
forbid_1_consequence:   CI 只验证配方能构建，未验证消费者实际调用安装产物；真实目标执行失败会在发布后才暴露。
forbid_2_pattern:       claim.*functional.*pass.*skip|skip.*functional.*test.*pass
forbid_2_reason:        非目标 runner 的跳过不能被申报为 target 功能测试通过。
forbid_2_consequence:   测试报告夸大覆盖范围，审查与用户无法区分构建证据和运行证据。

principles:             P005, P013
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E403, E356, E423]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E543-draft-0335.md
last_updated:           2026-09-20
source_event:           lcab 1.0b12: x86 Linux runner used an OHOS/armv8 host/build profile; can_run() was true but the target ELF could not run locally. L1e required an explicit package artifact assertion before the non-target skip.

authors:                nyaco3 <aqjCItYW1QmEJQuF.gcw_XDpqZ8sO@noreply.gitcode.com>
